    "updated_at": "2026-08-27T23:02:56Z",
    "body": "Thanks! I get a little confused about what to do with placeholders in `<select multiple>` since I think that [we don't have a great way of doing placeholders in select multiple yet](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12246#issuecomment-4654445215) - supportive of making that better though!\n\nAs for the empty optgroup and wrapper div cases, they should both be invalid since the placeholder is selected, right? Does the spec get that wrong? I can see that in chromium the wrapper div one is invalid but the empty optgroup one is not valid - is it just a chrome bug?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
