    "updated_at": "2026-09-03T12:56:48Z",
    "body": "For `<select multiple size=1>`, maybe we can make that better, but in the meantime, IMHO we should revert the change in the spec.\n\nFor the optgroup one, I guess we could go either way: change the spec or mark it as an implementation bug.\n\nThe div one is certainly a ~~Firefox implementation~~ spec bug.",
