    "body": "I find it confusing to have the `<select multiple size=1>` placeholder thing in the spec. I don't think anybody implements it, and I haven't found any tests for it.\nAnd I think implementing it as currently specced would be bad.\n\nThe [behavior described in #12246](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12246#issuecomment-4654445215) seemed fine to me, but I'm not sure what the next step would be.\n\nI made a little demo https://codepen.io/sb3nder/pen/WbpxrWZ to visualize it and maybe gather some additional feedback.",
