    "created_at": "2026-09-30T17:57:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-30T17:57:22Z",
    "body": "> The behavior described in #12246 seemed fine to me, but I'm not sure what the next step would be.\n\nI think that we would need to implement behavior to make the placeholder of a `<select multiple size=1>` be automatically selected by default, make it automatically get deselected when any other option becomes selected, and make it automatically become selected again when all other options are deselected. Not sure how complex this would be given the existing complexity of the algorithms that handle option selectedness.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
