    "updated_at": "2026-10-19T23:18:56Z",
    "body": "> I did what you are describing in this demo: https://codepen.io/sb3nder/pen/WbpxrWZ\n\nThanks! Yeah I think that matches the idea I was thinking of, I can see that choosing an option automatically deselects the placeholder and that deselecting other options automatically selects the placeholder.\n\n> Another thing to consider is that this placeholder would also be needed when the select doesn't have the required attribute.\n\nDoes the required attribute change anything in this scenario or as the select element already exists today besides how it gets valid/invalid pseudos and form submission stuff?",
